step Duskwood
  zone Duskwood
  goto 75.8,45.3 "Duskwood"

# Duskwood, Alliance ~22.7 to ~25.4.
#
# Route from the simulator's consensus Alliance route (Human export, visit 5:
# Duskwood 22.7-25.4), written out as a playable guide; not play-tested on
# Forever yet.
#
# Flow: Darkshire (every quest giver in walking order from the flight master,
# the Bronze Tube from Herble and Look to the Stars handed in at once) -> the
# Tranquil Gardens Cemetery -> west along the road: Watcher Dodds, Raven Hill
# (Memory of Valor), Sven's camp, the Hushed Bank (wolves, spiders and their
# venom), Abercrombie, the Raven Hill Cemetery (ghouls) -> back east: Watcher
# Dodds, the Yorgen Farmstead -> Darkshire (The Night Watch handed in with the
# other hand-ins), Blind Mary -> west: Abercrombie, Sven -> Darkshire -> the
# Skeletal Horrors south-east of town (Rot Blossoms, The Night Watch's
# Horrors) -> Darkshire -> west: Abercrombie, the ghouls, the cemetery's
# Skeletal Fiends, Jitters, Sven (the end: ride north through Elwynn to
# Stormwind for training, Shamans in Ironforge by the Deeprun Tram, and the
# Auberdine boat from Stormwind Harbor, where the next guide starts). The
# Night Watch's second part is handed in on the Duskwood return
# (07-thousand-needles), where its third part starts.
#
# Deviations from the export:
# - Look To The Stars (174): the export finds the Bronze Tube on Venture Co.
#   machines in Stonetalon (a 1-2% drop). Herble Baubbletump sells it in
#   Darkshire, next to Viktori: handed in on the first visit, and its second
#   part (175) handed to Blind Mary on her visit; the Insane Ghoul (177, level
#   26) waits for the Duskwood return (07-thousand-needles).
# - Wolves at Our Heels (226) is turned in on the second visit to Sven's camp
#   (Lars stands beside Sven) instead of walking back west for it.
# - Hearthstone: the export hearths twice on the first loop (23.7 and 24.4);
#   here once from the Yorgen Farmstead and once after the second western loop,
#   so the cooldown allows both.
# - The Darkshire flight path and hearth bind belong to the export's Redridge
#   visit (it arrives here bound); repeated in the first step in case you come
#   in without them.
# - Dropped Awaiting Word (236): a no-XP breadcrumb to Watcher Callahan at
#   Manor Mistmantle, a detour north the route never passes otherwise.
#
# Class quests: Rogues finish Mathias and the Defias with Klaven's Tower
# (2360, 2359, Poisons) at the end: Agent Kearnen and the tower stand just
# over the Westfall border from Raven Hill, and Mathias Shaw is in Stormwind
# on the way to the boat. Optional for Rogues there: The Touch of Zanzil
# (2607-2609, Doc Mixilpixil in the Barracks cellar; Wildflowers, a Leaded
# Vial and a Bronze Tube from Stormwind vendors, the thread in the city),
# 1,305 XP without leaving Stormwind.
# Human Paladins hand the Defias Script (1787, from Henze Faulk in
# 04-redridge-mountains) to Gazin Tenorm at the Stormwind stop and learn
# Redemption from Duthorian Rall (1788).
#
# Left out (not in the export): Jitters' Growling Gut and Dusky Crab Cakes
# (163, 5, 93), Seasoned Wolf Kabobs (90: Cooking), The Weathered Grave chain
# (225: ends at the elite Mor'Ladim), Ira's Dagger (96137: it starts from a
# drop of the Lost Stalkers, Forever's new Duskwood mobs, at an unknown rate,
# and is not in the new consensus either).
# Refresh (2026): Merrick's Bow (96138) now has a known start, a drop of the
# Lost Watchers; the new consensus does it at 28 with the ogres of Vul'Gol,
# so it is an optional extra in 07-thousand-needles' Duskwood return. The
# Valor Family (98447, a Forever quest listed for Duskwood, level 27)
# is not in our data: no giver, objective or ender we can place, so it is
# not added. The Valor Family 96139 (Sirra Von'Indi) stays as it is.
# Checked and skipped: The Legend of Stalvan (98) needs 97 (the Stalvan
# chain through Westfall and Elwynn, not on this route) and ends at Stalvan
# Mistmantle, an elite.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshire

step Darkshire
  tip Follow the road south from Three Corners into Duskwood; Darkshire lies on the east side of the forest.
  tip No Bronze Tube for Look to the Stars? Herble Baubbletump sells it in the house beside Viktori, in limited stock; Neal Allen in Menethil Harbor sells it too.
  getfp "Darkshire" npc 2409              -- Felicia Maline, at the north end of town
  accept 101                              -- Madame Eva, in her house by the tavern; inside
  accept 66                               -- Madame Eva, inside
  sethome "Darkshire" npc 6790            -- Innkeeper Trelayne, Scarlet Raven Tavern
  turnin 66                               -- Clerk Daltry, in the town hall
  accept 96139                            -- Sirra Von'Indi, in the house behind the town hall
  accept 56                               -- Commander Althea Ebonlocke, in the town hall
  accept 173                              -- Calor, by the town hall
  accept 164                              -- Elaine Carevin, at the south end of town; inside
  accept 165
  tip Viktori's house stands at the east end of town. Herble Baubbletump sells engineering goods in the house beside it.
  buy 4371 x1 npc 3133 optional           -- Bronze Tube, from Herble Baubbletump, if you have none
  accept 174                              -- Viktori Prism'Antras, inside
  turnin 174
  accept 175                              -- For Blind Mary, on the hill south-east of town

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tranquil Gardens

step Tranquil Gardens Cemetery: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip Skeletal Warriors and Skeletal Mages walk among the graves south-east of Darkshire, below Blind Mary's house on the hill. Every skeleton in Duskwood can drop a Skeleton Finger.
  tip Careful: Because the skeletons stand near each other, running straight in tends to pull several at once.
  collect 2378 quest 101                  -- Skeleton Finger
  kill 203 quest 56                       -- Skeletal Mage
  kill 48 quest 56                        -- Skeletal Warrior

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West

step Watcher Dodds
  tip Watcher Dodds stands south of the road, at the Yorgen Farmstead.
  accept 245

step Raven Hill
  tip Continue west to Raven Hill. The Memory of Valor glows by the ruined house south of the road.
  collect 281046 quest 96139              -- Raven Hill Tome, from the Memory of Valor

step Sven's Camp
  tip Follow the road north-west past the cemetery to Sven's camp on the far west edge of the forest. Lars stands beside Sven.
  turnin 164                              -- Sven Yorgen
  accept 95
  accept 226                              -- Lars

step The Hushed Bank: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip Rabid Dire Wolves roam the woods around the cemetery and Abercrombie, Starving Dire Wolves the hills north-east of him. Pygmy Venom Web Spiders crawl east of the cemetery and drop the venom. Every ghoul of the cemetery's northern half can drop a fang.
  tip Careful: Wolves and other spider types share the area along the Westfall border, so you can easily pull several mobs at once.
  kill 565 quest 226                      -- Rabid Dire Wolf
  kill 213 quest 226                      -- Starving Dire Wolf
  kill 539 quest 245                      -- Pygmy Venom Web Spider
  collect 1130 quest 101                  -- Vial of Spider Venom: Pygmy Venom Web Spiders, Venom Web Spiders and Green Recluses

step Abercrombie
  tip The hermit's shack stands in the woods north-east of the Raven Hill Cemetery.
  turnin 165
  accept 148

step Raven Hill Cemetery: kill these as you meet them
  zone Duskwood
  tip The cemetery lies north of the village. Skeletal Horrors and Skeletal Fiends walk its southern half. Mor'Ladim, an elite, wanders the graves: keep away from him.
  collect 1129 quest 101                  -- Ghoul Fang
  collect 2378 quest 101                  -- Skeleton Finger

